# Office Lease Renewal Agreement — Acme Corp Headquarters

**Document type:** Lease agreement
**Classification:** Internal
**Parties:** Acme Corp (Tenant) and Meridian Properties LLC (Landlord)
**Date:** November 2024

---

## Lease Summary

This document records the renewal of Acme Corp's headquarters office lease at 1200 Technology Blvd, Suite 400.

| Term              | Value                        |
|-------------------|------------------------------|
| Lease start       | January 1, 2025              |
| Lease end         | December 31, 2027            |
| Monthly rent      | $48,500                      |
| Annual escalation | 3%                           |
| Space             | 22,500 sq ft                 |
| Parking           | 120 spaces included          |

## Key Provisions

- **TI Allowance:** $250,000 for workspace refresh in Year 1
- **Renewal option:** One 2-year option at 95% of then-market rate
- **Subletting:** Permitted with landlord consent (not to be unreasonably withheld)
- **Assignment:** Not permitted without landlord consent

## Annual Rent Schedule

| Year | Base Rent/Month | Annual Total |
|------|----------------|-------------|
| 2025 | $48,500        | $582,000    |
| 2026 | $49,955        | $599,460    |
| 2027 | $51,454        | $617,448    |

